    "title_en": "The cycle C9 does not admit uniform mixing",
    "abstract_en": "We study continuous-time quantum walks (CTQWs) on cycles. In particular, we prove that the cycle $C_9$ does not admit uniform mixing at any time via algebraic geometry and Gröbner basis techniques to rule out all cyclic 9-roots.",
